  "start_here": "Say to your AI: \"Keep who appeared in my recording sample-call.wav.\" It runs the keep-who-appeared-in-a-recording recipe: tool:who-is-in-this and tool:find-faces say who was heard and seen, and tool:keep-who-appeared keeps each stretch as a row in list:appearances linked to the person, the recording, the seconds and the place.",
